      "What changed is that AI can reduce the cost and time involved in producing key business assets:\n| Business model | What AI helps produce |\n| --- | --- |\n| AI influencer page | Character concepts, images, short-form video assets, captions, and content variations |\n| Subscription commerce | Store structure, product imagery, copy, ad concepts, and creative variations |\n| Digital products | Research organisation, outlines, drafts, examples, templates, and supporting assets |",
