      "When someone purchases through a tracked affiliate link, the brand or affiliate programme may pay a commission. The page does not need to manufacture or ship the product.\nHow the model works\n1. Choose a defined audience and content category.\n2. Create a virtual character with a coherent identity and reason to exist.\n3. Develop repeatable content themes.\n4. Generate visual assets and supporting copy.\n5. Publish consistently and learn from audience response.\n6. Recommend products that genuinely fit the audience.\n7. Use tracked affiliate links and disclose the commercial relationship.\n8. Measure clicks, conversions, commission, and audience quality.\nThe character is not a decorative detail. It is the positioning of the page.\nWhy the character matters more than the volume of content\nA generic attractive face promoting unrelated products looks like an advertisement. A character with a recognisable perspective, knowledge area, and consistent audience promise gives people a reason to follow.",
