      "Appendix A — One-Page Business Model Canvas\nComplete this before investing significant time or money.\n| Question | Your answer |\n| --- | --- |\n| Which model am I testing? |  |\n| Who is the specific customer? |  |\n| What problem or need do they have? |  |\n| What do they use today? |  |\n| What is my offer? |  |\n| Why is it meaningfully different? |  |\n| How will I reach potential customers? |  |\n| How will the business earn money? |  |\n| What are the variable costs? |  |\n| What are the biggest risks? |  |\n| What is the smallest credible test? |  |\n| What evidence will make me continue, change, or stop? |  |",
      "Appendix B — Model-Specific Metrics\n| Model | Primary metrics | Warning signs |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| AI influencer page | Relevant audience growth, meaningful engagement, profile visits, affiliate clicks, approved commissions | Views without audience fit, clicks without purchases, low trust, dependence on one account |\n| Subscription commerce | Contribution margin, acquisition cost, retention, cancellations, failed payments, refunds, fulfilment reliability | Negative contribution, rapid churn, stock problems, rising support burden |\n| Digital products | Qualified traffic, conversion, average order value, refunds, customer feedback, repeat purchases | High traffic with no sales, generic product, poor usage, high refunds, no distribution |"
